{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46174","headline":"避地毘陵寒月上孙徽使君兼寄东阳王使君三首 二 · 贯休","name":"避地毘陵寒月上孙徽使君兼寄东阳王使君三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常忆双溪八咏前，讲诗论道接清贤。\n文欺白凤真难及，药捻红蕖岂偶然。\n花湿瑞烟粘玉磬，帘垂幽鸟啄苔钱。\n自怜不是悠悠者，吟嚼真风二十年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46174.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46174","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}